<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n47980" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεᾱτρ-ικός</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θεητρικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for the theatre, theatrical</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μουσική</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pol.</u>
					1342a18
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄψις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Alex.</u>
					19
				</span></i>
			: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κά, τά</span>, <i>properties</i>, etc., <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				510.7
			</span></i>(Ephesus, <span class="entity">ii A.D.</span>): <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κοί,
					οἱ</span>, <i>actors</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BCH</u>
				44.88
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Lagina</span>). Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς, εἰπεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.1076c
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>pretentious</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Medic.</u>
				4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θ. μέν . . ἀνίατρον δέ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antyll.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				10.23.24
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ θ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.7a
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				15e
			</span></i>. Adv.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-κῶς, πολεμεῖν, στρατηγεῖν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Luc.</u>
				11
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				<u>Lys.</u>
				21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόδες θ</span>. dub. sens. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				11(2).203
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>B</u>
				13
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Inscr.Délos</u>
				291b30
			</span></i>.</div>
